        "text": "🚀 Qwen4-Max from @Alibaba_Qwen is now live on Novita AI, available from day one!\n\nA new MoE model for complex coding, professional tools, and long-running agent workflows.\n\n🔹 Native vision\n🔹 1M-token context window\n🔹 Stronger tool use and long-horizon task execution https://t.co/wj8juKNGsZ"
