        "text": "Qwen4-Max from @Alibaba_Qwen is now available on AI Gateway.\n\n• Built for 3D modeling and game dev\n• 25% lower pricing than Qwen3.8-Max\n• Up to 384K output tokens\n\n𝚊𝚕𝚒𝚋𝚊𝚋𝚊/𝚚𝚠𝚎𝚗𝟺-𝚖𝚊𝚡\n\nhttps://t.co/jyo81d30J0"
