        "text": "BREAKING: Qwen4-Max by @Alibaba_Qwen ranks #4 on Python-PPTX arena with an Elo rating of 1302 and #5 on Spreadsheet arena with an Elo rating of 1336.\n\nOn Spreadsheet arena, this marks a 30-position jump from Qwen’s previous model, Qwen 3.7 Max, and a 379-point Elo increase. On https://t.co/ESkd2037FD https://t.co/Y1wTXwaVy0"
